Package: peridial
Title: Peritoneal Dialysis Units Peritonitis Indicators
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ernest", "Caballero", , "ernestcabs@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A standardised R framework for ingesting, validating, and
    summarising clinical peritoneal (PD) unit data. Nested S3
    classes represent the PD unit, patients, catheters, and peritonitis
    episodes, supporting reproducible calculation of ISPD-recommended
    peritonitis rate and peritonitis-free percentage indicators from
    longitudinal catheter and infection records.
